Changelog: 20-11-2026 23:06:26

Added. Test 22 (Hardware Sensors) reports the CPU and GPU rails when the bc250_vrm kernel module is loaded: input and
rail voltages, currents, power and the regulators' temperatures, with a warning or an error at the regulator's own
limits. Without the module it says so in one line.

